# --- Secrets -----------------------------------------------------------------
# WHY: even though every VITE_-prefixed variable is compiled into the public
# JavaScript bundle (and is therefore NOT a secret), .env files here routinely
# pick up backend URLs, API keys pasted by mistake, and per-developer config.
# Keep them out of git; commit .env.example with placeholders instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
